  "fullVisibleText": "Back to tasks\nUndo\nAdd task\nSettings & data\nAppearance & language\nBackups & transfer\nReminders & installation\nTask maintenance\nHelp & about\nBackups & transfer\nTasks changed since the last export · exported today. Export again\nTask backup\n\nDownload a restorable backup of all tasks, including archived tasks. Saved views, preferences and recovery history are not included.\n\nDownload backup\nRestore from a backup\n\nChoose a JSON task backup. Preview it before deciding to merge or replace.\n\nChoose backup file\nLocal recovery history\n\nReview recovery points in this browser, then export or restore the selected tasks.\n\nRecovery history\nOther data tools\nSpreadsheet export\n\nDownload a CSV report of all tasks, including archived tasks. Reports cannot restore tasks.\n\nExport all tasks as CSV\nTransfer saved views\n\nExport or import saved searches, filters and layouts in a separate file. Your tasks stay unchanged.\n\nTransfer saved views\nBrowser storage protection\n\nReview storage usage, persistent storage and the protection your browser can provide.\n\nReview storage status\nImport preview\n×\nPre-import snapshot download was triggered. Confirm the file is saved, then confirm replacement again.\nChoose how to import\nMerge into current tasks\nNew names are added. For matching names, review Keep both, Skip import or Replace local before confirming.\nReplace all current tasks\nReplace mode replaces all current tasks with the tasks in this file.\nWhat will change\n\nCurrent tasks: 4. File tasks: 3. All current tasks will be replaced. Total afterward: 3.\n\nReplace import protection\nThe pre-import snapshot download was triggered. Confirm the file is saved, then confirm again to replace data.\nRestore checklist\n!\nLocal name matches\n3 imported tasks match current names; merge mode can handle them one by one.\n!\nCurrent data impact\nReplace mode will overwrite 4 current tasks; choose merge mode to keep them.\nPassed checks: 6\nFile checks and change details\nCancel\nReplace with 3 tasks",
